#. Translators: Shown when action is unavailable because Remote Access is disabled.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remotePlusPlus\__init__.py:159
#: addon\globalPlugins\remotePlusPlus\__init__.py:189
#: addon\globalPlugins\remotePlusPlus\__init__.py:222
