msgid "Remote++"
msgstr "Remote++"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid "Enhances NVDA Remote with productivity features for power users."
msgstr ""
"Migliora NVDA Remote con funzionalità di produttività per utenti esperti."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid ""
"## 0.5.0\n"
"\n"
"- Prevent duplicate Remote++ items in the Remote Access menu.\n"
"- Show \"Connect to Default Server\" as soon as an auto-connect connection "
"is set.\n"
"- Improve group handling and reordering in filtered connection lists.\n"
"- Improve dialog focus handling and local server detection."
msgstr ""

